stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNINITIALIZED: system start
    UNINITIALIZED --> WAITING_MODEL: ensureLLM() / spawnLlama()
    
    WAITING_MODEL --> MODEL_READY: stdout shows "> " or "Enter no prompt"
    WAITING_MODEL --> MODEL_ERROR: spawn error
    MODEL_ERROR --> SCHEDULE_RESTART: llmBus.emit("error", err)

    MODEL_READY --> IDLE_PROCESSING: llmBus.emit("ready")
    note right of MODEL_READY: restartCount=0, restartDelay=1000
    
    IDLE_PROCESSING --> PROCESSING_REQUEST: processQueue() / write stdin
    
    PROCESSING_REQUEST --> READING_RESPONSE: waiting for stdout
    READING_RESPONSE --> CRASH_DETECTED: process "close" non-zero code
    READING_RESPONSE --> RESPONSE_COMPLETE: pattern "<br/>> $" detected
    RESPONSE_COMPLETE --> IDLE_PROCESSING: done / processQueue() next

    CRASH_DETECTED --> EMIT_CRASH: llmBus.emit("crash", code)
    EMIT_CRASH --> INCREMENT_RESTART: restartCount++
    
    INCREMENT_RESTART --> CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS
    CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS --> EXIT_ABORT: restartCount > 5
    CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS --> APPLY_BACKOFF: still <= 5

    APPLY_BACKOFF --> DOUBLE_DELAY: restartDelay = min(delay*2, 30000)
    DOUBLE_DELAY --> WAIT_DELAY: setTimeout(delay)
    WAIT_DELAY --> SPAWN_AGAIN: spawnLlama()
    SPAWN_AGAIN --> WAITING_MODEL

    note right of CHECK_MAX_RESTARTS
      Exponential backoff: 1s 2s 4s 8s 16s, max 30s, max 5 retries
    end note
    note right of EXIT_ABORT
      Abandon after 5 consecutive failures - process.exit(1)
    end note
    note right of CRASH_DETECTED
      Causes: OOM, segfault, model incompatibility, disk I/O error
    end note
